Package: IsoNetAnalyzeR
Title: Isoform-Level Protein Interaction Network Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Nikolas", "Mumm", , "s242825@dtu.dk", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tools for constructing, analyzing, and querying
    isoform-level protein interaction networks. Includes functions for
    network summary statistics, degree distribution analysis, sticky
    isoform and gene detection, and virtual pulldown simulations.
    Developed as part of a master's thesis at the Technical University
    of Denmark (DTU).
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
